        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: KKWQ-FM, KRWB (AM)\n- Companies: Border Broadcasting\n- Places: Warroad, Minnesota, Northwest Angle, Angle Township, Lake of the Woods County, Minnesota\n- Topics: local radio broadcasting\n\nFacts:\n- The Northwest Angle is part of northern Lake of the Woods County, Minnesota.\n- The Northwest Angle is known simply as the Angle by locals and is coextensive with Angle Township.\n- KKWQ-FM 92.5 is a small local radio station broadcasting from Warroad, Minnesota.\n- KRWB (AM) is owned and operated by Border Broadcasting.\n- KKWQ-FM is a sister station of KRWB (AM) and is also owned and operated by Border Broadcasting.",
